<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.9050.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.9050.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>THe National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.9050 against the dollar, up from 2.9100 yesterday and at 1.8200 against the mark, up from 1.8215, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
